못한 밤","stagingScene":"direction-v2:outcome-10","camera":{"intent":"conversation","targets":[{"speaker":"담허"},{"actor":"p-archer"},{"actor":"p-knight"}],"padding":40,"maxScale":1.05,"participants":[{"actor":"boss"},{"actor":"p-mage"},{"actor":"p-archer"},{"actor":"p-knight"}],"id":"10:outcome:11","speakerPolicy":"world"}}],["설오","홍만의 장부도 북문 뒤부터는 비어 있었습니다. 고향 사람들의 흔적을 놓칠 수는 없습니다. 저도 그 길을 보겠습니다.",{"storyId":"act1-v6:outcome-10","storyTitle":"소단 — 놓지 못한 밤","stagingScene":"direction-v2:outcome-10","camera":{"intent":"conversation","targets":[{"speaker":"설오"},{"actor":"p-mage"},{"actor":"p-knight"}],"padding":40,"maxScale":1.05,"participants":[{"actor":"boss"},{"actor":"p-mage"},{"actor":"p-archer"},{"actor":"p-knight"}],"id":"10:outcome:12","speakerPolicy":"world"}}],["소단","남은 매듭을 정리하고… 나도 같이 가고 싶어요. 어디서 오는지도 모른 채 또 묶어 두고 싶지는 않아요.",{"storyId":"act1-v6:outcome-10","storyTitle":"소단 — 놓지 못한 밤","stagingScene":"direction-v2:outcome-10","camera":{"intent":"portrait","targets":[{"speaker":"소단"}],"padding":40,"maxScale":1.05,"participants":[{"actor":"boss"},{"actor":"p-mage"},{"actor":"p-archer"},{"actor":"p-knight"}],"id":"10:outcome:13","speakerPolicy":"world"}}],["설오","같이 가죠. 남은 매듭부터 함께 정리하고요.",{"storyId":"act1-v6:outcome-10","storyTitle":"소단 — 놓지 못한 밤","stagingScene":"direction-v2:outcome-10","camera":{"intent":"conversation","targets":[{"speaker":"설오"},{"actor":"p-mage"},{"actor":"p-knight"}],"padding":40,"maxScale":1.05,"participants":[{"actor":"boss"},{"actor":"p-mage"},{"actor":"p-archer"},{"actor":"p-knight"}],"id":"10:outcome:14","speakerPolicy":"world"}}],["서술","소단이 굳은 손가락을 하나씩 폈다. 잠시 숨을 고른 뒤, 방울을 챙겨 일행 곁에 앉았다.",{"kind":"narration","art":"road","storyId":"act1-v6:outcome-10","storyTitle":"소단 — 놓지 못한 밤","stagingScene":"direction-v2:outcome-10","presentation":"inline","camera":{"intent":"situation","targets":[{"actor":"boss"},{"actor":"p-mage"},{"actor":"p-archer"},{"actor":"p-knight"}],"padding":65,"maxScale":0.8,"id":"10:outcome:15","speakerPolicy":"none"}}]]}],"honro